WEBVTT

00:27.240 --> 00:27.880
General

00:27.960 --> 00:29.080
General Shilang

00:29.160 --> 00:31.080
Everything in the city has been arranged

00:31.160 --> 00:32.800
There are agents in the city to assist

00:32.880 --> 00:33.640
The northern garrison

00:33.760 --> 00:35.427
Most are already dead drunk

00:35.880 --> 00:36.640
Two warriors

00:36.720 --> 00:38.160
Will open the city gates soon

00:38.240 --> 00:40.400
To welcome the general into the city

00:40.480 --> 00:41.880
Good dog

00:41.960 --> 00:43.360
Good dog

00:43.920 --> 00:45.280
You'll be rewarded

00:45.360 --> 00:46.760
Thank you, General

00:47.440 --> 00:48.720
Prepare the army

00:48.800 --> 00:50.200
Ready for the assault

00:50.600 --> 00:51.640
Yes

00:51.720 --> 00:52.120
General

00:52.280 --> 00:53.680
General

00:53.800 --> 00:54.440
Your subordinate

00:54.520 --> 00:55.160
For the general

00:55.240 --> 00:57.080
Would naturally die a thousand deaths

00:57.160 --> 00:57.920
But

00:58.000 --> 00:59.280
Could you release my

00:59.360 --> 01:01.040
Wife and daughter first?

01:02.280 --> 01:03.040
Of course

01:03.120 --> 01:04.787
I'll not only release them

01:05.160 --> 01:07.040
But also have a dozen Wuzhao warriors

01:07.120 --> 01:08.787
Take good care of them

01:11.960 --> 01:13.320
General, count me in

01:13.400 --> 01:14.040
Count me in too

01:14.120 --> 01:15.520
Good

01:35.280 --> 01:36.680
Courageous

01:36.920 --> 01:38.320
Shilang

01:38.440 --> 01:39.840
You're a beast

01:51.160 --> 01:52.560
You beast

01:59.480 --> 02:00.520
Xuan people

02:00.600 --> 02:03.267
A bunch of soft worms in the dirt

02:03.600 --> 02:05.000
Wuzhao warriors

02:05.600 --> 02:07.080
Who dares to be the vanguard?

02:07.160 --> 02:08.560
I will

02:09.200 --> 02:10.280
Good

02:10.360 --> 02:11.400
I'll give you a unit

02:11.480 --> 02:12.840
Break the city today

02:12.920 --> 02:14.320
Yes

02:43.720 --> 02:45.120
The gates are moving

02:45.800 --> 02:46.680
Brothers

02:46.760 --> 02:47.920
Follow me in the charge

02:48.000 --> 02:49.160
Gold, silver, and treasures

02:49.240 --> 02:50.640
We'll take first

03:04.400 --> 03:05.560
Why are there people

03:05.640 --> 03:07.040
Something's not right

03:17.000 --> 03:18.400
We've been tricked

03:20.720 --> 03:22.120
Fire arrows

03:25.760 --> 03:27.040
The enemy is trapped

03:27.120 --> 03:28.520
Kill

03:45.120 --> 03:45.880
Report

03:45.960 --> 03:46.880
General

03:46.960 --> 03:48.360
The troops we just sent out

03:48.440 --> 03:49.400
Have been completely wiped out

03:49.480 --> 03:50.880
What?

03:51.360 --> 03:52.600
Everyone, speak up

03:52.680 --> 03:54.080
What should we do?

04:05.720 --> 04:06.880
General

04:06.960 --> 04:08.320
Perhaps Prince of Jin

04:08.400 --> 04:09.800
Saw through our plan

04:10.200 --> 04:11.867
And turned it against us

04:12.520 --> 04:14.187
Do you think I'm blind?

04:16.360 --> 04:17.760
Call them back

04:18.120 --> 04:19.080
General, calm your anger

04:19.160 --> 04:20.120
General, calm your anger

04:20.200 --> 04:21.080
This plan

04:21.160 --> 04:22.440
Isn't a complete failure yet

04:22.520 --> 04:23.640
As I know

04:23.720 --> 04:25.387
The Wuyang commander Chen Ying

04:25.760 --> 04:26.680
Is backed by

04:26.760 --> 04:28.320
Xuan Kingdom's Prince of Ning

04:28.400 --> 04:29.840
Who doesn't get along with Prince of Jin

04:29.920 --> 04:30.880
We can spread the false news that Prince of Jin

04:31.040 --> 04:32.440
Got the seal

04:33.040 --> 04:34.440
To Wuyang

04:36.160 --> 04:37.280
You Xuan people

04:37.360 --> 04:38.760
Understand Xuan people

04:40.440 --> 04:41.680
Do as he says

04:41.760 --> 04:42.560
Also

04:42.640 --> 04:43.960
Have those who came line up

04:44.040 --> 04:45.040
Yes
